D.  Employee Queries 
1) Insert and display the documents in the Employee collection. 
  use Employee
  db.col.insertMany([{Name:"Smitu",Salary:100000,Dept:"ID",City:"Mumbai"},{Name:"Romal",Salary:150000,Dept:"ID",City:"Thane"},{Name:"Sujal",Salary:90000,Dept:"Tester",City:"Bandra"},{Name:"Manav",Salary:30000,Dept:"Finance",City:"Kurla"},{Name:"Swathi",Salary:4000,Dept:"Developer",City:"Pune"}])
  db.col.find()

2) Display details of employees who live in Mumbai. 
  db.col.find({City:"Mumbai"})

3) Display details of employee staying in Kurla and salary greater than 19000 
  db.col.find({City:"Kurla",Salary:{$gt:19000}})

4) Display details of the employee whose salary is greater than equal 10000 but less than 20000. 
  db.col.find({Salary:{$gte:10000,$lt:20000}})

5) Display details of employees staying in either thane or mumbai and salary greater than 10000. 
  db.col.find({$or:[{City:"Mumbai"},{City:"Thane"}],Salary:{$gt:10000}})

6) Display details of employee whose salary is not equal to 10000 and working in either developer or tester department. 
  db.col.find({$or:[{Dept:"Developer"},{Dept:"Tester"}],Salary:{$ne:10000}})
